# Keep the build context to the sources build/ict/Dockerfile copies. A checkout
# that has run native builds or `serve` holds large, often root-owned trees
# (cache/, workspace/, webui-workspace/) that would otherwise be sent to the
# Docker daemon on every build, or fail it outright when unreadable.
.git
.github
.vscode
build
!build/ict
builds
downloads
benchmark-logs
cache
tmp
workspace
webui-workspace
.ai-cache
dist
*.log
/image-composer-tool
/live-installer
web/node_modules
web/dist
image-templates/.ict-adv-*.yml
